    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89878" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσπαιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking upon</i>: hence, <i>sudden, fresh</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ π. μὴ τύχοι κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					347
				</span></i>
