				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.43.3
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προσπαίου</span> as
			Adv., <i>suddenly, newly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1166b35
